# Logical Route Registry

- Read `docs-governance/canonical/LOGICAL_ROUTE_REGISTRY.md` before adding routes.
- No browser path is the source of truth; define logical route ids first.
- Every route must declare required context keys and a render mode.
- No route may bypass policy gates or reference undeclared views/actions.
